{"sections":[{"slug":"Dirichlet卷积","section":{"metadata":{"slug":{"Plain":"Dirichlet卷积"},"ext":{"Plain":"md"},"title":{"Plain":"Dirichlet <span lang=\"zh\">卷积</span>"},"taxon":{"Plain":"<span lang=\"zh\">百科</span>. "},"author":{"Lazy":[{"Local":{"url":"/SimplicialCat","text":"SimplicialCat"}}]},"page-title":{"Plain":"Dirichlet 卷积"},"data-taxon":{"Plain":"百科"}},"content":{"Lazy":[{"Plain":"\n<h2><span lang=\"zh\">定义</span></h2>\n<p><span lang=\"zh\">对于数论函数</span> $f,g\\colon \\mathbb{N}_+ \\to \\mathbb{C}$,\n<span lang=\"zh\">其</span> Dirichlet <span lang=\"zh\">卷积</span> $f*g \\colon \\mathbb{N}_+ \\to \\mathbb{C}$ <span lang=\"zh\">定义为</span>\n$$\r\n(f*g) (n) = \\sum_{ij=n}f(i)g(j).\r\n$$</p>\n<h2><span lang=\"zh\">例</span></h2>\n<p>"},{"Local":{"url":"/Möbius函数","text":"Möbius <span lang=\"zh\">函数</span>"}},{"Plain":" $\\mu$ <span lang=\"zh\">与常值函数</span> $1$ <span lang=\"zh\">的</span> Dirichlet <span lang=\"zh\">卷积是</span> $\\delta$ <span lang=\"zh\">函数</span> (<span lang=\"zh\">即</span> Dirichlet <span lang=\"zh\">卷积的单位元</span>):\n$$\r\n\\sum_{i|n}\\mu(i)=\\begin{cases}\r\n    1 &amp; n=1\\\\\r\n    0 &amp; n&gt;1\r\n\\end{cases}\r\n$$</p>\n"}]}}}]}